/pull/100224.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100224.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"EDIT: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106147 should be merged first, so I have marked this as draft.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the `print_verbose` macro to `PRINT_VERBOSE`, for 3 reasons:\r\n\r\n1. Fixes a name conflict with GDExtension `UtilityFunctions`: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/pull/1668\r\n2. Fixes a name conflict with the engine's internal `VariantUtilityFunctions`, avoiding this awkwardness:\r\n<img width=\"387\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-09 at 2 35 36 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d5adc13-ad4d-4ebd-83c8-b768a20a6064\">\r\n\r\n3. Capitalizing the macro is consistent with the style used for all other macros in Godot.\r\n\r\nThis PR may minorly affect compatibility with third-party modules, but does not change the exposed scripting API. However, it is trivial for third-party modules to either update their code or add `print_verbose` as an alias.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100224/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100224/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}